    {
      "key": "skill:4881",
      "type": "skill",
      "id": 4881,
      "name": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 This plant-shaped monster is found near the Blazing Swamp. According to one theory, Palatanos is the result of a failed experiment. After Ipos arose from purgatory, his influence and magic were not the equal of Hallate, and he was unable to create the same kind of powerful underlings. Too proud to ask Hallate for help, however, he tried honing his skills on relatively simple monsters. Despite Palatanos' strange origin and appearance, he can still be a potentially dangerous adversary.",
      "url": "/lu4/skill/4881-raid-boss/1"
    },
